GreenPut surface components
===========================

The shared marketing surface in `libs/shared/design/src/surface/` translates
layout measurements from Puppertino 2.0 (Dachshund) into semantic HTML and
cascade-layer CSS. It is not a copy of Puppertino's class stylesheet.

  Puppertino — https://github.com/codedgar/Puppertino
  Copyright (c) 2019 Edgar Pérez
  Licensed under the MIT License.

  Measurements used from that project: floating tab-bar height (62px),
  capsule radius, 30px backdrop blur, 180% saturation, translucent bar
  and list surfaces, and the grouped-list radius. Markup, selectors,
  and colour are GreenPut's: `data-bn` attributes, the leaf accent
  `#4EAF7C`, and the system font stack
  `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif`.

  Icons are GreenPut's original stroke set in `libs/shared/design/src/icons.ts`
  and the GreenPut leaf mark. No SF Symbols are included.

Apple Design Resources (iOS, iPadOS, and macOS 27 kits) were consulted as a
visual comparison only. No kit image, extracted SVG, font file, or symbol
is shipped in this repository.

